UID:3D1XpXTEIX
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 155 mins (2h35m)\n\nOne of the major achievements of
  twenty-first-century cinema thus far\, Béla Tarr’s mesmeric parable of
  societal collapse is an enigma of transcendent visual\, philosophical\, a
 nd mystical resonance. 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-t
 heaters/werckmeister-harmonies\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
