 nation of human resilience in the face of evil takes place in medieval Jap
 an\, where the family of an exiled nobleman are left to fend for themselve
 s and become wrenched apart by vicious slave traders.\n\nhttps://www.siff.
 net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/sansho-the-bailiff\n\nEstimated st
 art: 18:45
